<title>USA: AnnTaylor Stores Q1 May 3 net rises.</title>
<headline>AnnTaylor Stores Q1 May 3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.25		    $0.08</p>
<p> Net			  6,475		    1,812</p>
<p> Revs		     197,064		  184,467</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   1,715		    1,666</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said results for both the current and prior periods include charges of $0.11 and $0.10 per share, respectively, for the deduction of goodwill amortization.</p>
<p>Full name is AnnTaylor Stores Corp.</p>
